{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Moving Forward with Cat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Galileo said<br><i>&quot;And yet it moves.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I thought<br><i>&quot;Perhaps the same applies to cats?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Moving Forward with Cat&quot; is a physics-based platformer about gravity and pendulum mechanics. Understand the laws of physics and aim for new heights together with a cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique pendulum mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Gravity-defying gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Carefully crafted stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Minimalist art style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Moving Forward with Cat,&quot; you cannot fully control the cat. Instead, you need to think ahead and plan the timing of jumps, swings, and launches to overcome each challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play, you'll develop an intuitive understanding of the game's physics and begin to feel the growth of your own playing skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discovery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover stages that change as the game progresses, new mechanisms, and increasingly difficult challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without direct control, prediction and adaptation are necessary. Each level requires thoughtful planning and execution while utilizing momentum, inertia, and gravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Growth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While playing the game, you'll realize<br><i>&quot;Wait... am I getting better at this game?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the joy of growth that you discover yourself, not joy given by someone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If everything goes smoothly, you can complete the main story in about 3 hours.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Clear All Stages","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3672320/773f08ddd1b9f1eab0cec13cc3091d1388c78250.jpg"},{"name":"0 death clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3672320/dca7ae94c07beb78cbb51568d46d287edadc46b9.jpg"},{"name":"10 death clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3672320/7c2937e5d2e07c582a1d59ff34b12df7a1ebbf05.jpg"},{"name":" 50 death clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3672320/28bb877b8a441ad5d025366b1b28c08b77b548e0.jpg"},{"name":"10min clear.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3672320/1b37b60d2581542e5d6b4c8d24df1c8b9a17ecc2.jpg"},{"name":" 30min clear.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3672320/b13ad3f1eb050936ecb8db029254b00ea115fbb7.jpg"},{"name":" 60min clear.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3672320/318e4f15315cec5f5d5e268f40aa6e9ccb3b2250.jpg"},{"name":"1001 Deaths of a Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3672320/3b2c64e63a0f2d897fb93a10ba5e4d06c7750b9b.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672320?t=1754580849","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672320?t=1754580849","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672320/97ff3783260f6df4161c6bccd586efad213c1654/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754580849","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672320/97ff3783260f6df4161c6bccd586efad213c1654/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754580849","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Moving Forward with Cat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Galileo said<br><i>&quot;And yet it moves.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I thought<br><i>&quot;Perhaps the same applies to cats?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Moving Forward with Cat&quot; is a physics-based platformer about gravity and pendulum mechanics. Understand the laws of physics and aim for new heights together with a cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique pendulum mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Gravity-defying gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Carefully crafted stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Minimalist art style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Moving Forward with Cat,&quot; you cannot fully control the cat. Instead, you need to think ahead and plan the timing of jumps, swings, and launches to overcome each challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play, you'll develop an intuitive understanding of the game's physics and begin to feel the growth of your own playing skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discovery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover stages that change as the game progresses, new mechanisms, and increasingly difficult challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without direct control, prediction and adaptation are necessary. Each level requires thoughtful planning and execution while utilizing momentum, inertia, and gravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Growth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While playing the game, you'll realize<br><i>&quot;Wait... am I getting better at this game?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the joy of growth that you discover yourself, not joy given by someone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If everything goes smoothly, you can complete the main story in about 3 hours.</p>","developers":["Daruma The Factory, Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672320/ed72443841e8e3ec7bfdbce366e8b9b0ff1d7222/header.jpg?t=1754580849","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3672320/882947/af6e64f9e5379e77fb445ebdfa9db8fa3ce20376/1750421871/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747072211","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3672320/882947/af6e64f9e5379e77fb445ebdfa9db8fa3ce20376/1750421871/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747072211","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3672320/882947/af6e64f9e5379e77fb445ebdfa9db8fa3ce20376/1750421871/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747072211","id":257134133,"name":"trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257134133/c703b0a6afa345e00748ecaf66fa6e66e3847d16/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747072211"}],"name":"Moving Forward with Cat","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Moving Forward with Cat - $11.99 USD","packageid":1293601,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":1199}],"title":"Buy Moving Forward with Cat"}],"packages":[1293601],"pc_requirem